SUMMARY:Stay ACTIVE ALL Summer Long
DESCRIPTION:Stay ACTIVE ALL Summer Long\nACTIVE MONTHLY MEMBERS\nALL active monthly members entered in a raffle to WIN 1 month FREE \n8 One Month Prizes/ 8 WINNERS \nSome Conditions Apply:\nWinning member must be active June 23 through to Sept 22 to qualify\nMonthly (includes SILVER\, GOLD Multi\, & GOLD members)\nWinners -One Month FREE Membership to be applied to Sept 23\, 2026
